{"strongs": "H0990", "word": "בֶ֫טֶן", "translit": "be.ten", "root": "בטן", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "belly, body, womb", "definition": "I. בֶ֫טֶן noun feminine Num 5:25 belly, body, womb (Arabic ) — ׳ בּ absolute Judg 13:7 +; בָּ֑טֶן v Judg 13:5 +; construct בֶּטֶן Ps 139:13 +; suffix בִּטְנִי Job 3:10 +; בִּטְנְךָ Deut 7:13 +; בִּטְנֵךְ Gen 25:23 בִּטְנוֺ Job 15:2 +, etc.; — 1. a. belly, abdomen , of man Judg 3:21 ; Judg 3:22 of woman Num 5:21 ; Num 5:22 ; Num 5:27 as beautiful in form Song 7:3 as seat of hunger Prov 13:25 as eating Ezek 3:3 (|| מֵעִים ); compare Prov 18:20 (figurative); as seat of passion, avarice, etc. Job 20:20 ; Job 20:23 in figure of God's casting riches out of extortioner's belly Job 20:15 (|| וַיְקִאֶנּוּ ), compare also Ps 17:14 figurative of innermost part of man = inmost soul Prov 18:8 = Prov 26:22 ; Prov 20:27 ; Prov 20:30 (all ׳ חַדְרֵי ב ); as seat of intell. faculties (= English breast or bosom ) Prov 22:18 (compare מֵעִים Ps 40:9 ) Job 15:2 ; Job 15:35 ; Job 32:18 , רוּחַ בִּטְנִי v Job 15:19 as trembling at theophany Hab 3:16 . \\ \\ b. belly of hippopotamus Job 40:16 . \\ \\ c. בֶּטֶן שְׁאוֺל Jonah 2:3 (Jonah's prayer: || מְצוּלָה בִּלְבַכ יַמִּים ). 2. body , opposed to soul Ps 31:10 (opposed to נֶפֶשׁ ), also Ps 44:26 (opposed to id. ; — on this compare Zim Bp 71 ). 3. womb Gen 25:23 ; Gen 25:24 ; Gen 38:27 (all J ) Hos 12:4 ; Job 10:19 (|| רֶחֶם v Job 10:18 ) Eccl 11:5 ; Job 31:15 הֲלֹא בַבֶּטֶן עשֵֹׁנִי עָשָׂ֑הוּ did not he that made me in the womb make him (|| וַיְכֻנֶנּוּ בָּרֶחֶם אֶחָד ); compare Ps 139:13 תְּסֻכֵּנִי בְּבֶטֶן , & Jer 1:5 especially ׳ פְּרִי ב i.e. offspring Gen 30:2 ( E ) Ps 127:3 ; Isa 13:18 ; Prov 31:2 בַּר בִּטְנִי = my son (|| בְּרִי ) compare בֶּןבִּֿטְנָהּ Isa 49:15 of birth יָצָא מִבֶּטֶן Job 1:21 ; Job 3:11 ; Eccl 5:14 בֶּטֶן alone = birth Hos 9:11 (|| לֵדָה , הֵרָיוֺן ), compare Figurative מִבֶּטֶן מִי יָצָא הַקָּ֑רַח Job 38:29 out of whose womb came the ice ? compare לֹא סָגַר דַּלְתֵי בִּטְנִי Job 3:10 i.e. of my (mother's) womb ; גָּחָה מִבֶּטֶן take, draw out of the womb , subject ׳ י (i.e. cause to be born) Ps 22:10 פְּרִי בֶטֶן used also of father Mic 6:7 , compare Ps 132:11 (David as ancestor of Messianic King); Job 19:17 בְּנֵי בִטְנִי sons of my body , of doubtful interpretation, perhaps = sons of my (mother's) womb , compare Job 3:10 ( Ges De ), i.e. my brother or men of my clan RS K 33 f. , others my sons ( Ew ), my grandsons ( Di ); also in addressing Israel As a whole (masculine suffix) Deut 7:13 ; Deut 28:4 ; Deut 28:11 ; Deut 28:18 ; Deut 28:53 ; Deut 30:9 , compare מַחֲמַדֵּי בִטְנָם Hos 9:16 beloved ones of their womb ; (מִבֶּטֶן) מִןהַֿבֶּטֶן = from birth Judg 13:5 ; Judg 13:7 ; Ps 58:4 ; Ps 71:6 , compare also Isa 44:2 ; Isa 44:24 ; Isa 46:3 (|| רָחַ֑ם ) Isa 48:8 ; Isa 49:1 ; Isa 49:5 מִבֶּטֶן נִמִּי id. Judg 16:17 ; Job 31:18 ; Ps 22:11 (|| רֶחֶם ). 4. architectural word of some rounded projection connected with the two pillars Jachin & Boaz 1Kgs 7:20 ( Klo reads הבית ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1028')\">BDB1028</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H990')\">H990</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1027')\">BDB1027</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1029')\">BDB1029</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>בֶ֫טֶן</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Num 5:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,25)\">Num 5:25</ref></sup> <highlightword>belly, body, womb</highlightword> (Arabic <placeholder565/>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Judg 13:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,7)\">Judg 13:7</ref> +; <bdbheb>בָּ֑טֶן</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Judg 13:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,5)\">Judg 13:5</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>בֶּטֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 139:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,13)\">Ps 139:13</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>בִּטְנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,10)\">Job 3:10</ref> +; <bdbheb>בִּטְנְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,13)\">Deut 7:13</ref> +; <bdbheb>בִּטְנֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,23)\">Gen 25:23</ref> <bdbheb>בִּטְנוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 15:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,2)\">Job 15:2</ref> +, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>belly, abdomen</highlight>, of man <ref ref=\"Judg 3:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,21)\">Judg 3:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,22)\">Judg 3:22</ref> of woman <ref ref=\"Num 5:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,21)\">Num 5:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,22)\">Num 5:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:27\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,27)\">Num 5:27</ref> as beautiful in form <ref ref=\"Song 7:3\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,3)\">Song 7:3</ref> as seat of hunger <ref ref=\"Prov 13:25\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,25)\">Prov 13:25</ref> as eating <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,3)\">Ezek 3:3</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מֵעִים</bdbheb>); compare <ref ref=\"Prov 18:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,20)\">Prov 18:20</ref> (figurative); as seat of passion, avarice, etc. <ref ref=\"Job 20:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,20)\">Job 20:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 20:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,23)\">Job 20:23</ref> in figure of God's casting riches out of extortioner's belly <ref ref=\"Job 20:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,15)\">Job 20:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>וַיְקִאֶנּוּ</bdbheb>), compare also <ref ref=\"Ps 17:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,14)\">Ps 17:14</ref> figurative of innermost part of man = <highlight>inmost soul</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 18:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,8)\">Prov 18:8</ref> = <ref ref=\"Prov 26:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,22)\">Prov 26:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 20:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,27)\">Prov 20:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 20:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,30)\">Prov 20:30</ref> (all <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חַדְרֵי ב</bdbheb>); as seat of intell. faculties (= English <highlight>breast</highlight> or <highlight>bosom</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Prov 22:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,18)\">Prov 22:18</ref> (compare <bdbheb>מֵעִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 40:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,9)\">Ps 40:9</ref>) <ref ref=\"Job 15:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,2)\">Job 15:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 15:35\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,35)\">Job 15:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 32:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,18)\">Job 32:18</ref>, <bdbheb>רוּחַ בִּטְנִי</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Job 15:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,19)\">Job 15:19</ref> as trembling at theophany <ref ref=\"Hab 3:16\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,16)\">Hab 3:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> belly of hippopotamus <ref ref=\"Job 40:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,16)\">Job 40:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>בֶּטֶן שְׁאוֺל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:3\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,3)\">Jonah 2:3</ref> (Jonah's prayer: || <bdbheb>מְצוּלָה בִּלְבַכ יַמִּים</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>body</highlight>, opposed to soul <ref ref=\"Ps 31:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,10)\">Ps 31:10</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>נֶפֶשׁ</bdbheb>), also <ref ref=\"Ps 44:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,26)\">Ps 44:26</ref> (opposed to <highlight>id.</highlight>; — on this compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Zim')\">Zim<sup>Bp 71</sup></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>womb</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,23)\">Gen 25:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 25:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,24)\">Gen 25:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 38:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,38,27)\">Gen 38:27</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Hos 12:4\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(28,12,4)\">Hos 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 10:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,19)\">Job 10:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רֶחֶם</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Job 10:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,10,18)\">Job 10:18</ref>) <ref ref=\"Eccl 11:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,11,5)\">Eccl 11:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 31:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,15)\">Job 31:15</ref> <bdbheb>הֲלֹא בַבֶּטֶן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עשֵֹׁנִי עָשָׂ֑הוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>did not he that made me in the womb make him</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>וַיְכֻנֶנּוּ בָּרֶחֶם אֶחָד</bdbheb>); compare <ref ref=\"Ps 139:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,13)\">Ps 139:13</ref> <bdbheb>תְּסֻכֵּנִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בְּבֶטֶן</bdbheb>, &amp; <ref ref=\"Jer 1:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,5)\">Jer 1:5</ref> especially <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פְּרִי ב</bdbheb> i.e. offspring <ref ref=\"Gen 30:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,2)\">Gen 30:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Ps 127:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"127\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"127\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,127,3)\">Ps 127:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 13:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,18)\">Isa 13:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,2)\">Prov 31:2</ref> <bdbheb>בַּר בִּטְנִי</bdbheb> = <highlight>my son</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>בְּרִי</bdbheb>) compare <bdbheb>בֶּןבִּֿטְנָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 49:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,15)\">Isa 49:15</ref> of birth <bdbheb>יָצָא מִבֶּטֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 1:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,21)\">Job 1:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 3:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,11)\">Job 3:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,14)\">Eccl 5:14</ref> <bdbheb>בֶּטֶן</bdbheb> alone = <highlight>birth</highlight> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,11)\">Hos 9:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>לֵדָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>הֵרָיוֺן</bdbheb>), compare Figurative <bdbheb>מִבֶּטֶן מִי יָצָא הַקָּ֑רַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 38:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,29)\">Job 38:29</ref> <highlight>out of whose womb came the ice</highlight> ? compare <bdbheb>לֹא סָגַר דַּלְתֵי בִּטְנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,10)\">Job 3:10</ref> i.e. <highlight>of my</highlight> (mother's) <highlight>womb</highlight>; <bdbheb>גָּחָה מִבֶּטֶן</bdbheb> <highlight>take, draw out of the womb</highlight>, subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> (i.e. cause to be born) <ref ref=\"Ps 22:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,10)\">Ps 22:10</ref> <bdbheb>פְּרִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בֶטֶן</bdbheb>used also of father <ref ref=\"Mic 6:7\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,7)\">Mic 6:7</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 132:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,11)\">Ps 132:11</ref> (David as ancestor of Messianic King); <ref ref=\"Job 19:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,17)\">Job 19:17</ref> <bdbheb>בְּנֵי בִטְנִי</bdbheb> <highlight>sons of my body</highlight>, of doubtful interpretation, perhaps = <highlight>sons of my (mother's)</highlight> <highlight>womb</highlight>, compare <ref ref=\"Job 3:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,10)\">Job 3:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup>), i.e. my brother or <highlight>men of my clan</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS<sup>K 33 f.</sup></lookup>, others <highlight>my sons</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup>), <highlight>my grandsons</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>); also in addressing Israel As a whole (masculine suffix) <ref ref=\"Deut 7:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,13)\">Deut 7:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,4)\">Deut 28:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,11)\">Deut 28:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,18)\">Deut 28:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:53\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,53)\">Deut 28:53</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 30:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,9)\">Deut 30:9</ref>, compare <bdbheb>מַחֲמַדֵּי בִטְנָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:16\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,16)\">Hos 9:16</ref> <highlight>beloved ones of their womb</highlight>; <bdbheb>(מִבֶּטֶן) מִןהַֿבֶּטֶן</bdbheb> = <highlight>from birth</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 13:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,5)\">Judg 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:7\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,7)\">Judg 13:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 58:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,4)\">Ps 58:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,6)\">Ps 71:6</ref>, compare also <ref ref=\"Isa 4